{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/12be16e0625434c2067dfd029ef95ec2.avif?t=1761745640\" width=1142 height=434 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, prosthetic bodies have become commonplace. Merrick is a purist living in such era.\u00a0He rejects the powerful mechanical body in favor of his fragile biological body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why does Merrick put himself through such pain? Wouldn't we all be free from disease, aging, and loss if we could just shed our flesh and adopt a body of metal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical Pulse is a story-driven puzzle adventure game.\u00a0Explore a\u00a0glamourous futuristic world and uncover the secrets of its biggest medical engineering company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven game without any complex controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various puzzles that blend with the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/99b5556f21bfa468149f0842a80769f1.avif?t=1761745640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras_big/99b5556f21bfa468149f0842a80769f1.avif?t=1761745640 width=1600 height=904 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/e7d18c43f2cbf13248d740e6ef1f7af7.avif?t=1761745640\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras_big/e7d18c43f2cbf13248d740e6ef1f7af7.avif?t=1761745640 width=1600 height=904 /></sp